  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion, ginger, and garlic and sauté until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the curry powder, turmeric, cumin, coriander, salt, and pepper. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped savoy cabbage and sliced bilo. Cook for 5 minutes.",
